# Week 1
## Pull
T_warmup[1-9] / used: none / 3x10-12 40s / progress: none / warmup: none
T_lift[1-3] / used: none / 3x10-15 90s / warmup: none/ progress: custom(inc: 5lb) {~
    var.minWeight = 1000
    var.repMargin = 0
    
    for (var.i in completedReps) {
        var.repTarget = minReps[var.i] * 0.3 + reps[var.i] * 0.7

        if (completedWeights[var.i] < var.minWeight) {
          var.minWeight = completedWeights[var.i]
          var.repMargin = completedReps[var.i] - var.repTarget
        } else if (completedWeights[var.i] == var.minWeight) {
          var.repMargin = min(var.repMargin, completedReps[var.i] - var.repTarget)
        }
    }

    weights = var.minWeight + (var.repMargin >= 0 ? state.inc : 0)
~}
T_lift10[1-3] / used: none / 3x10-15 90s / warmup: none / progress: custom(inc: 10lb) { ...T_lift }

